Accepted checkout now returns a checkout id before any order exists. The checkout and an unpublished `OrderRequested` outbox row are stored in `checkout_db`, and a later submit of the same cart returns that checkout without charging again.

`checkout/relay.py` publishes unpublished outbox rows to the `ecom.events` exchange and marks them published after RabbitMQ acks. `checkout/completion_checker.py` writes a `RefundRequested` outbox row and sets the checkout to `refund_pending` once an accepted checkout is past the completion window.

